message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper below."
title: "Reactive-Transport Model for Coupled Adsorption-Oxidation at Mn-Oxide Interfaces"
abstract: >-
  Reactive-transport model that recovers apparent first-order rate constants and
  pathway-selectivity metrics from flow-through reactor breakthrough curves,
  coupling reaction kinetics with a gamma residence-time distribution. Provides
  both a closed-form (semi-analytical) engine and a fully-coupled numerical-ODE
  engine, with reactor hydraulics fixed from a conservative tracer test.
